{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1347181-build-questions-how-to-make-a-magistrate","id":1347181,"title":"Build Questions: How to Make a Magistrate","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-09T00:12:40-08:00","id":1347181,"title":"Build Questions: How to Make a Magistrate","content":"When building a magistrate character as a starting Dragon-Blooded character, what do you consider important/salient choices for mechanical representation?<br /> <br /> I'm a little vague on things like what Merits would represent the character being a magistrate - for example, Backing (as magistrates technically have neither underlings or superiors per-se), Allies or Retainers (to represent the scribe traveling with them and other mortals who come under their thumb). <br /> <br /> Do they have Backing at all? Something else to represent their authority?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1807-serpent-axis","name":"Serpent Axis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1807_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T00:37:50-08:00","id":1347184,"title":"","content":"Hmmm... It might be more Influence than Backing.<br /> <br /> I'd also give them some Retainers or 1 dot of Followers to represent their Archons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T04:00:41-08:00","id":1347212,"title":"","content":"Depends.<br /> <br /> I'd definitely go with Influence over Backing. You absolutely could take Backing in the Magistracy to represent their authority as government officials, but as an organisation it's not what it was, and even in its hayday the Magistrates are pretty independent. Influence just fits better.<br /> <br /> Retainers/Followers is a good shout for Archons.<br /> <br /> I think Contacts and Allies are going to be invaluable. Danger Sense and Fast Reflexes were probably only possessed by a scant handful of Magistrates before the disappearance of the Empress, but are should probably be nearly universal now.<br /> <br /> I'd also consider why the Empress made you a Magistrate in the first place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}